WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Uncertainty and contingency. Notice what changes and what stays the same.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
LEARNING TARGET: Show ranges and rationale

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.000
THE BIG IDEA: A contingency is a reasoned allowance for identified uncertainty, not a guaranteed amount or permission to ignore missing quotes.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.000
WORKED EXAMPLE: If a scoped estimate is $1,000 and a 10% illustrative reserve is used, show $100 separately and explain the risk basis.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.000
PAUSE AND PREDICT: Estimate revision

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:59.000
MODEL LIMIT: Teaching relationships only—not live quotes, prices, tax advice or forecasts.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:06.000
TAKEAWAY: Show ranges and rationale
